    // Bath (Bayath-Thaw) -> Ban (Bayath-Nun): both derive from Bayath-Nun-Hay "to build" — offspring = one who is built/produced. TRUE ROOT: Ban (𐤁𐤍) ""daughter" shares root with "son""
    '𐤁𐤕': '𐤁𐤍',

