    // 7. HIFIL CONTRACTED FORMS — matres lectionis Yad in imperfect
    //    In Hifil imperfect the characteristic vowel is written with Yad (𐤉)
    //    as a vowel letter (matres lectionis). When pfm strips the person prefix,
